---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy – Transparent Data & Cookies Notice"
  description={`How ${siteConfig.name} handles reader preferences, local storage, advertising cookies, and analytics.`}
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <article class="content-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Publication Policy</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>
      Last updated: November 2026. At {siteConfig.name}, we believe in transparent, privacy-first practices.
      We do not require user accounts, logins, passwords, or personal profiles to read our productivity and smart work guides.
    </p>

    <h2>Local Storage and Reading Preferences</h2>
    <p>
      Your site preferences—specifically light or dark theme selection—are stored exclusively in your browser's
      <code>localStorage</code>. No personal identifying information is stored or transmitted to external servers.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising and Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      To help support the ongoing research and hosting of our scholarly publications, {siteConfig.name} works with
      third-party advertising partners, including <strong>Google AdSense</strong>.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior
        visits to this website or other websites on the Internet.
      </li>
      <li>
        Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our readers
        based on their visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Your Choices & Opt-Out:</strong> Readers may opt out of personalized advertising at any time
        by visiting
        <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >Google Ads Settings</a
        >. Alternatively, you can opt out of third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized
        advertising by visiting
        <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >www.aboutads.info</a
        >.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Server Logs and Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      Our pages are hosted through Cloudflare global content delivery network. When you access any page, standard
      HTTP request headers (such as IP address, user-agent, requested URL, and timestamp) are processed in real-time
      to route traffic securely, prevent DDoS attacks, and enforce security policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact and Questions</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or our editorial practices, please contact us at:
      <a href="mailto:privacy@clockgarden.com">privacy@clockgarden.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
